SUMMARY:[FREE] Neurodivergent Family Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T190000
DTSTAMP:20260618T115420Z
UID:b9289a8b6848fee4b71a682a2037793b@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nCost: Fre
 e\\nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nJoin us for a free eve
 ning where children and caretakers are invited to play in a sensory-friend
 ly\, neuro-affirming environment! We encourage the whole family to attend\
 , and therapists can join as well.\nNeurodivergent Family Nights are held 
 on the second Tuesday and fourth Thursday of each month from 5-7 pm (after
  we close to general admission).\nOn these nights\, we dim the lights in t
 he museum\, turn off the sounds\, and offer a limited capacity of 250 gues
 ts. Staff are happy and ready to assist with providing various materials\,
  including noise-cancelling headphones\, fidget toys\, sunglasses\, and we
 ighted materials for your convenience.\nRSVP HERE\n*Registration is requir
 ed and opens two weeks before each event. \nPlay Partners \nThe Epilepsy
  Support Network of Orange County is dedicated to building a community of
  support for families navigating the challenges of epilepsy. Understanding
  the unique needs of children and their parents\, we are here to provide s
 upport!  \nAUsome Sauce: the perfect blend of safety and connection fo
 r caregivers with young neurodiverse children. Our organization provides 
 a central place for community\, socialization\, educational resources\, a
 nd parent-to-parent connections. We aim to bring comfort in knowing they a
 re not alone in their journey.  \n&nbsp\;\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pr
 etendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-3-2026-02-26-2026-06-25/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-3-2026-
 02-26-2026-06-25/
