  program\, “Indian Mythology and Me\,” delights students with mythical
  legends and stories. Their workshop\, “Dancing in the Rain\,” highlig
 hts South Asia&#8217\;s geography and weather patterns through Bollywood d
 ance. And\, their residency series\, &#8220\;South Asian Dances\,&#8221\; 
 gives a lively introduction to various dances and traditional celebrations
 .\nSegerstrom Center for the Arts &#8211\; Arts Teach\nArts Teach: Arts Te
 ach is an education program by Segerstrom Center for the Arts that offers 
 assembly performances and workshops in Dance\, Music\, Theater\, and Visua
 l Arts for schools and community organizations.\nSocial Media: @segerstrom
 arts on Instagram\, TikTok\, and Facebook\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pret
