DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin Leaf by Leaf for a hands-on stor
 ytime and planting activity where children will learn about growing food\
 , decorate a shared microgreen pot\, and take home their own microgreen ki
 t to continue the experience!\nAbout the play partner: \nLeaf by Leaf is 
 a youth-led environmental and nutrition education organization that helps 
 children build a deeper connection with the food they eat. By giving chil
 dren the experience of growing food themselves\, Leaf by Leaf encourages 
 healthier eating habits while teaching young people how food\, nature\, an
 d sustainability are connected. \n\nInstagram: @leafb.yleaf \n\n\nEmail:
  leafbyleaf10@gmail.com\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/event
 s/microgreens-storytime-and-planting-activity-with-leaf-by-leaf/
