CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,family,Presentation
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Irvine Public Library - Katie Wheeler\\nCost: free\
 \nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nFor United States Semiquinc
 entennial\, explore the realities faced by pioneers traveling west from th
 e Midwest to California. Speaker Richard Foss looks at how they packed mon
 ths’ worth of food and supplies into wagons that doubled as shelter\, su
 rvived on simple diets\, and held onto small comforts along the trail. Dis
 cover the resilience and determination that shaped the settlement of the A
 merican West.\\n\\nMore info: https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event
 /16955136
LOCATION:Katie Wheeler Library Community Room \, Katie Wheeler Library
URL:https://irvinepubliclibrary.libcal.com/event/16955136
